    <string name="clipboard_guard_title">System clipboard guard</string>
    <string name="clipboard_guard_limit">Tries to shorten how long content remains in the system clipboard. Cannot prevent access at the instant of writing. Disabled by default.\n\nClearing from this page works without switching keyboards. Background protection requires ZeroInput to be selected, its service running and system callbacks available. Changes may be missed.</string>
